OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786744251
OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FThe government has issued a temporary
OL,7,Fban on the sale of disposable
OL,8,Fbarbecues as they pose a "significant
OL,9,Frisk to the public" amid ongoing
OL,10,Fheatwave conditions.
OL,12,FThe single-use grills "have been the
OL,13,Fcause of a number of serious wildfires
OL,14,Facross the country over the summer
OL,15,Fmonths", advice published online by
OL,16,Fthe government said.
OL,26,@tD@WOUwD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
