OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786744251
OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FIt added: "During the current drought
OL,7,Fand heatwave conditions, the
OL,8,Fgovernment considers that the supply
OL,9,Fand subsequent foreseeable use of
OL,10,Fdisposable barbecues poses a
OL,11,Fsignificant risk to the public, and
OL,12,Fthe environment, and therefore cannot
OL,13,Fbe considered a safe product.
OL,15,F"They should not be made available for
OL,16,Fsupply either in store or online at
OL,17,Fthe current time."
OL,19,FDowning Street said the guidelines
OL,20,Fwould be kept under review.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
