PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786744251
OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham had
OL,7,Findicated earlier this week that he
OL,8,Ffavoured a ban on disposable barbecues.
OL,10,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,11,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,12,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,13,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,15,FOn Friday, Burnham said his message to
OL,16,Fthe public was not to light an open
OL,17,Ffire "of any kind" and to dispose of
OL,18,Fcigarettes carefully amid a
OL,19,F"combustible" situation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786744251
OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FHe added: "You are taking risks with
OL,7,Fother people's homes, with other
OL,8,Fpeople's lives, if you act recklessly."
OL,10,FThe new advice and disposable barbecue
OL,11,Fban come as six firefighters were
OL,12,Ftaken to hospital suffering from smoke
OL,13,Finhalation and heat exhaustion after
OL,14,Fbattling wildfires across the West
OL,15,FMidlands.
OL,17,FParamedics have treated more than 50
OL,18,Fpeople across the region - including
OL,19,F19 who were taken to hospital - due to
OL,20,Fthe blazes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786744251
OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FGlynn Luznyj, chief fire officer for
OL,7,Fthe Staffordshire Fire Service, said
OL,8,Fon Friday that crews have been working
OL,9,F"tirelessly" through the night to get
OL,10,Ffires under control.
OL,12,F"We're working extremely hard to keep
OL,13,Feveryone safe, but we really need
OL,14,Fpeople to do their part to prevent
OL,15,Fthese fires from happening in the
OL,16,Ffirst place," he added.
OL,18,FIn the wake of the fires, the Burnham
OL,19,Fhas also announced that an "emergency
OL,20,Ffinancial support" package is being
OL,21,Fdrawn up for fire services.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
