OL,3,CGovernment issues temporary ban on
OL,4,Cdisposable barbeques amid UK wildfires
OL,6,FHe added that the country has to "face
OL,7,Fup" to the "changing climate" and
OL,8,Fneeds to transition to "more clean
OL,9,Fenergy".
OL,11,FYesterday the UK recorded its hottest
OL,12,Fday of the year so far, as
OL,13,Ftemperatures soared to more than 38C
OL,14,Fin London.
OL,16,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,17,Four political experts are across all
OL,18,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,19,Fto the latest episode below...
